{"segments": [{"start_ms": 1830, "duration_ms": 8530, "text": "[音楽]"}, {"start_ms": 4839, "duration_ms": 9321, "text": "草月そ僕の故郷の花でねとても美しいん"}, {"start_ms": 10360, "duration_ms": 5400, "text": "だまあ僕ほどではないんだけどねそろそろ"}, {"start_ms": 14160, "duration_ms": 3440, "text": "行こう"}, {"start_ms": 15760, "duration_ms": 5200, "text": "か"}, {"start_ms": 17600, "duration_ms": 8240, "text": "フリーレンいつか君に見せてあげ"}, {"start_ms": 20960, "duration_ms": 4880, "text": "たいそう機会があれば"}, {"start_ms": 28960, "duration_ms": 3000, "text": "ね"}, {"start_ms": 32800, "duration_ms": 5240, "text": "あるとは思っていたけどまさかこれほどと"}, {"start_ms": 35879, "duration_ms": 2161, "text": "は"}, {"start_ms": 39960, "duration_ms": 4800, "text": "ね遅くなったね"}, {"start_ms": 45650, "duration_ms": 5730, "text": "[音楽]"}, {"start_ms": 57840, "duration_ms": 3000, "text": "ヒンメル"}]}